//www.edmundoptics.com/knowledge-center/application-notes/optics/understanding-waveplates/","scope":"供應商應用筆記，說明雙折射、延遲量、零級與多級波片的差異及消色差設計；不含製程參數。","scopeEn":"Vendor application note on birefringence, retardance, the difference between zero-order and multi-order plates and achromatic designs; no process parameters."},{"title":"加州大學聖塔芭芭拉分校 MAT 288 講義：偏振與波片","titleEn":"UC Santa Barbara MAT 288 lecture: Polarization and waveplates","publisher":"University of California, Santa Barbara (course notes)","url":"https://courses.ece.ucsb.edu/MAT288/MAT288_Sp10Cohen/Lecture%2013%20Polarization%20and%20waveplates.pdf","scope":"大學課程講義，涵蓋 Stokes 向量、偏振片類型、以 Malus 定律量消光比、波片的波長與角度敏感度及 Faraday 隔離器。","scopeEn":"University lecture notes covering Stokes vectors, polarizer types, extinction measured with Malus's law, waveplate wavelength and angle sensitivity and Faraday isolators."},{"title":"Thorlabs：偏振光學產品指南","titleEn":"Thorlabs: Polarization optics product guide","publisher":"Thorlabs","url":"https://www.thorlabs.com/navigation.cfm?guide_ID=8","scope":"供應商產品導覽，列出波片、偏振片、Fresnel 菱體與偏振分光器的類別、典型消光比與延遲量規格；用於規格表對照。","scopeEn":"Vendor product guide listing waveplate, polarizer, Fresnel-rhomb and polarizing-splitter classes with typical extinction and retardance specifications; used for specification comparison."},{"title":"J.A. Woollam：橢偏術常見問題","titleEn":"J.A. Woollam: Ellipsometry FAQ","publisher":"J.A. Woollam Co.","url":"https://www.jawoollam.com/resources/ellipsometry-faq","scope":"說明 Ψ、Δ 的定義、為何用比值量測、入射角選擇與模型擬合的基本概念；為廠商公開教材，不含專有演算法。","scopeEn":"Explains the definitions of Ψ and Δ, why ratio measurement is used, the choice of angle of incidence and the basics of model fitting; public vendor material without proprietary algorithms."},{"title":"HORIBA：橢偏術學院","titleEn":"HORIBA: Ellipsometry Academy","publisher":"HORIBA Scientific","url":"https://www.horiba.com/id/scientific/products/ellipsometers/ellipsometry-academy/","scope":"光譜橢偏術原理、儀器架構（偏光鏡、調制器、分析器）與應用的公開教學入口。","scopeEn":"Public tutorial portal on spectroscopic-ellipsometry principles, instrument architecture (polarizer, modulator, analyzer) and applications."},{"title":"SVC 教程 M-102：橢偏術導論","titleEn":"SVC tutorial M-102: Introduction to Ellipsometry","publisher":"Society of Vacuum Coaters","url":"https://www.svc.org/tutorials/m/m-102-introduction-to-ellipsometry/","scope":"專業學會的橢偏術課程大綱，涵蓋菲涅耳反射、薄膜模型與資料分析；用於確認本課的教學範圍符合業界教程。","scopeEn":"Professional-society course outline covering Fresnel reflection, thin-film models and data analysis; used to confirm that the course scope matches industry tutorials."},{"title":"普渡大學 RIC：J.A. Woollam 橢偏術教程講義","titleEn":"Purdue University RIC: J.A. Woollam ellipsometry tutorial handout","publisher":"Purdue University, Chemistry Research Instrumentation Center","url":"https://www.chem.purdue.edu/ric/docs/Gaertner-Ellipsometer-Handout-2---JAWoollamCo-Ellipsometry-Tutorial.pdf","scope":"大學儀器中心轉載的廠商教程，含 Ψ–Δ 軌跡圖與薄膜週期性的說明；作為輔助閱讀。","scopeEn":"Vendor tutorial redistributed by a university instrumentation centre, including Ψ–Δ trajectories and thin-film periodicity; supplementary reading."},{"title":"濱松光子學：LCOS-SLM 光相位調制器產品頁","titleEn":"Hamamatsu Photonics: LCOS-SLM optical phase modulator","publisher":"Hamamatsu Photonics K.K.","url":"https://www.hamamatsu.com/jp/en/product/optical-components/lcos-slm.html","scope":"說明反射式液晶相位調制器的用途（波前控制、像差修正、雷射加工）、寬頻鋁電極與特定波長介電多層膜兩種反射層，以及高功率耐受（700 W 級）與每單位面積建議照度；不含像素層級設計資料。","scopeEn":"Describes reflective liquid-crystal phase modulators for wavefront control, aberration correction and laser processing, the broadband aluminium versus wavelength-specific dielectric mirror options, high-power tolerance (700 W class) and recommended irradiance per unit area; no pixel-level design data."},{"title":"HOLOEYE：空間光調制器產品總覽","titleEn":"HOLOEYE Photonics: Spatial light modulators overview","publisher":"HOLOEYE Photonics AG","url":"https://holoeye.com/spatial-light-modulators/","scope":"列出 3.74 到 8 µm 像素間距、1920×1080 到 4160×2464 解析度的 LCOS 相位調制器，以及各型號在不同波長的相位行程（例如 2π 於 420–650 nm、2.5π 於 800 nm）；公開規格頁。","scopeEn":"Lists LCOS phase modulators with 3.74 to 8 µm pitch and 1920×1080 to 4160×2464 resolution, plus per-model phase strokes at different wavelengths (for example 2π across 420–650 nm, 2.5π at 800 nm); a public specification page."},{"title":"Meadowlark Optics：1920×1200 空間光調制器規格頁","titleEn":"Meadowlark Optics: 1920 x 1200 spatial light modulator","publisher":"Meadowlark Optics","url":"https://www.meadowlark.com/shop/slms/1920-x-1200-spatial-light-modulator/","scope":"提供 8 µm 像素、95.6% 填充因子、各波長液晶響應時間（532 nm ≤ 15 ms、1550 nm ≤ 55 ms）、零階反射率、校正後波前（532 nm 為 λ/7）與區域式電壓對相位校正等公開數值。","scopeEn":"Gives public numbers for 8 µm pixels, 95.6% fill factor, LC response times by wavelength (≤ 15 ms at 532 nm, ≤ 55 ms at 1550 nm), zeroth-order reflectance, calibrated wavefront (λ/7 at 532 nm) and regional voltage-to-phase calibration."}]},{"courseId":"a416","overview":"以可遷移的原理、量測與驗證比較相近儀器；關聯不表示同一廠商、世代或驗收規格。","overviewEn":"Compare neighbouring instruments through transferable principles, measurements and validation; a link does not imply the same vendor, generation or acceptance requirements.","related":[{"id":"a417","title":"超穎透鏡製程研究","titleEn":"Metalens fabrication research","transfer":"可遷移「純量繞射、相位量化與效率」與「浮雕量測與繞射級功率分佈」的建模、量測與誤差預算方法；超穎透鏡製程研究的元件、尺度與允收條件需重新設定。","transferEn":"The modelling, measurement and error-budget methods of \"Scalar diffraction, phase quantisation and efficiency\" and \"Relief metrology and diffraction-order power distribution\" transfer, while components, scales and acceptance conditions of Metalens fabrication research must be respecified.","difference":"本課聚焦以純量繞射效率、相位階數與蝕刻深度控制，把微影製作的繞射元件做到可驗收的效率與零級洩漏；超穎透鏡製程研究則以從超穎原子相位庫到 EBL／DUV 曝光、高深寬比蝕刻與聚焦效率驗收的平面透鏡製程工程為重點，不能直接沿用參數或允收值。","differenceEn":"This course focuses on bringing lithographically made diffractive elements to acceptable efficiency and zero-order leakage through scalar efficiency, phase-level count and etch-depth control; Metalens fabrication research centres on from meta-atom phase libraries to EBL/DUV exposure, high-aspect-ratio etching and focusing-efficiency acceptance of flat lenses, so parameters and acceptance values do not transfer unchanged.","practice":["比較系統邊界：列出「2π 相位摺疊與 M 階階梯」與「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」的輸入、輸出與主要干擾。","把本課算例的一個假設移到超穎透鏡製程研究，標出可沿用的方程與必須重設的參數。","以「色差、景深與消色差極限」為例，設計一項能區分兩種系統的驗證量測，並註明不確定度。"],"practiceEn":["Compare system boundaries: list the inputs, outputs and main disturbances of “2π phase wrapping and the M-level staircase” and “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice”.","Move one assumption of this course's worked example to Metalens fabrication research, separating reusable equations from parameters that must be respecified.","Using \"Chromatic shift, depth of focus and achromatic limits\", design a verification measurement that distinguishes the two systems and state its uncertainty."],"referenceUrls":["https://seas.harvard.edu/news/metalens-meets-stars","https://www.nist.gov/laboratories/tools-instruments/nanofab-tool-jeol-jbx-6300-fs-direct-write-electron-beam-lithography","https://www.nilt.com/products/meta-optics/","https://newsroom.st.com/media-center/press-item.html/t4458.html"],"place":{"name":"哈佛大學工程與應用科學學院奧爾斯頓園區","nameEn":"Harvard SEAS Science and Engineering Complex, Allston","city":"哈佛大學工程與應用科學學院奧爾斯頓園區","cityEn":"Harvard SEAS Science and Engineering Complex, Allston","country":"美國","countryEn":"United States","lat":42.3637,"lng":-71.1259,"address":"Harvard Science and Engineering Complex Allston","addressEn":"Harvard Science and Engineering Complex Allston","mapQuery":"Harvard Science and Engineering Complex Allston","coordinateScope":"人工選定的公開機構、設施或城市之近似代表座標；非設備定位、施工入口或參訪許可。研究機構或公司園區可能被多門課共用。","coordinateScopeEn":"Manually selected approximate public institution, facility or city reference; not equipment coordinates, an access point or a visit permit. Institutions may be shared by several courses."},"why":"可遷移「純量繞射、相位量化與效率」與「浮雕量測與繞射級功率分佈」的建模、量測與誤差預算方法；超穎透鏡製程研究的元件、尺度與允收條件需重新設定。","whyEn":"The modelling, measurement and error-budget methods of \"Scalar diffraction, phase quantisation and efficiency\" and \"Relief metrology and diffraction-order power distribution\" transfer, while components, scales and acceptance conditions of Metalens fabrication research must be respecified."},{"id":"a418","title":"全像光學元件製作","titleEn":"Holographic optical-element fabrication","transfer":"可遷移「純量繞射、相位量化與效率」與「浮雕量測與繞射級功率分佈」的建模、量測與誤差預算方法；全像光學元件製作的元件、尺度與允收條件需重新設定。","transferEn":"The modelling, measurement and error-budget methods of \"Scalar diffraction, phase quantisation and efficiency\" and \"Relief metrology and diffraction-order power distribution\" transfer, while components, scales and acceptance conditions of Holographic optical-element fabrication must be respecified.","difference":"本課聚焦以純量繞射效率、相位階數與蝕刻深度控制，把微影製作的繞射元件做到可驗收的效率與零級洩漏；全像光學元件製作則以以 Kogelnik 耦合波理論為核心的體全像元件記錄、材料、布拉格選擇性量測與系統整合為重點，不能直接沿用參數或允收值。","differenceEn":"This course focuses on bringing lithographically made diffractive elements to acceptable efficiency and zero-order leakage through scalar efficiency, phase-level count and etch-depth control; Holographic optical-element fabrication centres on volume-hologram element recording, materials, Bragg-selectivity metrology and system integration built on Kogelnik coupled-wave theory, so parameters and acceptance values do not transfer unchanged.","practice":["比較系統邊界：列出「2π 相位摺疊與 M 階階梯」與「記錄層內的折射率條紋」的輸入、輸出與主要干擾。","把本課算例的一個假設移到全像光學元件製作，標出可沿用的方程與必須重設的參數。","以「重建條件誤差預算」為例，設計一項能區分兩種系統的驗證量測，並註明不確定度。"],"practiceEn":["Compare system boundaries: list the inputs, outputs and main disturbances of “2π phase wrapping and the M-level staircase” and “Index fringes inside the recording layer”.","Move one assumption of this course's worked example to Holographic optical-element fabrication, separating reusable equations from parameters that must be respecified.","Using \"Replay-condition error budget\", design a verification measurement that distinguishes the two systems and state its uncertainty."],"referenceUrls":["https://solutions.covestro.com/en/brands/bayfol","https://wasatchphotonics.com/technologies/volume-phase-holographic-gratings/","https://www.eso.org/sci/facilities/paranal/instruments/muse/inst.html","https://www.horiba.com/int/scientific/technologies/diffraction-gratings/diffraction-gratings-ruled-and-holographic/"],"place":{"name":"ESO 帕瑞納天文台 VLT 第四單元（MUSE 體相位全像光柵）","nameEn":"ESO Paranal Observatory VLT Unit 4 (MUSE VPH gratings)","city":"ESO 帕瑞納天文台 VLT 第四單元（MUSE 體相位全像光柵）","cityEn":"ESO Paranal Observatory VLT Unit 4 (MUSE VPH gratings)","country":"智利","countryEn":"Chile","lat":-24.6272,"lng":-70.4042,"address":"Paranal Observatory Chile","addressEn":"Paranal Observatory Chile","mapQuery":"Paranal Observatory Chile","coordinateScope":"人工選定的公開機構、設施或城市之近似代表座標；非設備定位、施工入口或參訪許可。研究機構或公司園區可能被多門課共用。","coordinateScopeEn":"Manually selected approximate public institution, facility or city reference; not equipment coordinates, an access point or a visit permit. Institutions may be shared by several courses."},"why":"可遷移「純量繞射、相位量化與效率」與「浮雕量測與繞射級功率分佈」的建模、量測與誤差預算方法；全像光學元件製作的元件、尺度與允收條件需重新設定。","whyEn":"The modelling, measurement and error-budget methods of \"Scalar diffraction, phase quantisation and efficiency\" and \"Relief metrology and diffraction-order power distribution\" transfer, while components, scales and acceptance conditions of Holographic optical-element fabrication must be respecified."}],"references":[{"title":"MIT 林肯實驗室技術報告 854：二元光學技術—多階繞射元件的理論與設計","titleEn":"MIT Lincoln Laboratory Technical Report 854: Binary optics technology, theory and design of multi-level diffractive optical elements","publisher":"MIT Lincoln Laboratory via Defense Technical Information Center","url":"https://apps.dtic.mil/sti/pdfs/ADA213404.pdf","scope":"1989 年公開技術報告，推導 N 階繞射元件的第一級效率（2、4、8、16 階分別約 0.41、0.81、0.95、0.99）與光罩製程原理；本課的效率公式直接以此為基礎。","scopeEn":"Public 1989 technical report deriving first-order efficiency of N-level elements (about 0.41, 0.81, 0.95 and 0.99 for 2, 4, 8 and 16 levels) and the mask-process principles; the course's efficiency formulas rest directly on it."},{"title":"Holo/Or：繞射光學元件製作能力","titleEn":"Holo/Or: Diffractive optical-element fabrication capabilities","publisher":"Holo/Or Ltd.","url":"https://www.holoor.co.il/capabilities","scope":"製造商公開能力頁，說明直寫微影、光阻、乾式電漿蝕刻、灰階寫入、熔融石英與 ZnSe 基材及光束整形元件類型；不含製程配方。","scopeEn":"Manufacturer capabilities page describing direct-write lithography, resist, dry plasma etching, grayscale writing, fused-silica and ZnSe substrates and beam-shaping element types; no process recipe."},{"title":"Jenoptik：繞射光學元件與微光學","titleEn":"Jenoptik: Diffractive optical elements and micro-optics","publisher":"Jenoptik AG","url":"https://www.jenoptik.com/products/optical-systems/optical-precision-components/diffractive-optical-elements-doe-microoptics","scope":"製造商產品頁，說明以晶圓級微影製作的繞射元件類別、材料與應用波段；用於規格與應用脈絡。","scopeEn":"Manufacturer product page describing wafer-level lithographically made diffractive element classes, materials and application bands; used for specification and application context."},{"title":"哈佛 SEAS 新聞：10 公分 DUV 微影超穎透鏡拍攝天體","titleEn":"Harvard SEAS news: Metalens meets stars","publisher":"Harvard John A. Paulson School of Engineering and Applied Sciences","url":"https://seas.harvard.edu/news/metalens-meets-stars","scope":"公開說明以 DUV 投影微影與場拼接製作 10 公分、約 187 億根奈米柱的全玻璃超穎透鏡，以及其熱、冷與振動測試；不含設計檔或製程參數。","scopeEn":"Publicly describes a 10 cm all-glass metalens of about 18.7 billion nanopillars made by DUV projection lithography with field stitching, plus its thermal and vibration tests; no design files or process parameters."},{"title":"NIST NanoFab：JEOL JBX-6300FS 電子束直寫系統工具頁","titleEn":"NIST NanoFab tool page: JEOL JBX-6300FS direct-write electron-beam lithography","publisher":"NIST Center for Nanoscale Science and Technology","url":"https://www.nist.gov/laboratories/tools-instruments/nanofab-tool-jeol-jbx-6300-fs-direct-write-electron-beam-lithography","scope":"列出 100 keV、2 nm 光點、10 nm 特徵、1 mm 寫場、拼接與套刻小於 20 nm、最大 200 mm 晶圓等公開能力，為課程中 EBL 數值的依據。","scopeEn":"Lists public capabilities of 100 keV, 2 nm spot, 10 nm features, 1 mm write field, stitching and overlay under 20 nm and wafers up to 200 mm, the basis for the EBL numbers in this course."},{"title":"NIL Technology：超穎光學元件產品頁","titleEn":"NIL Technology: Meta optics product page","publisher":"NIL Technology ApS","url":"https://www.nilt.com/products/meta-optics/","scope":"說明近紅外超穎光學元件採矽於玻璃基板、以奈米壓印為基礎的量產與半導體等級設備組裝；屬產品分類頁，不含製程配方。","scopeEn":"Describes near-infrared meta-optical elements on silicon-on-glass substrates, nanoimprint-based mass production and assembly with semiconductor-class equipment; a product page, no process recipe."},{"title":"STMicroelectronics 新聞室：與 Metalenz 推出消費電子首個光學超穎表面技術","titleEn":"STMicroelectronics newsroom: Metalenz and ST deliver first optical metasurface technology for consumer devices","publisher":"STMicroelectronics","url":"https://newsroom.st.com/media-center/press-item.html/t4458.html","scope":"2022 年 6 月的公開新聞稿，證實超穎表面光學元件在半導體產線量產並用於感測模組；僅為商業化脈絡，不含技術規格。","scopeEn":"June 2022 public press release confirming metasurface optics manufactured on semiconductor lines for sensing modules; commercial context only, no technical specifications."},{"title":"Covestro：Bayfol 工程與全像光聚合物薄膜品牌頁","titleEn":"Covestro: Bayfol engineering and holographic photopolymer films","publisher":"Covestro AG","url":"https://solutions.covestro.com/en/brands/bayfol","scope":"說明 Bayfol HX 自顯影全像光聚合物的記錄波長範圍（440–680 nm 等級）、三層結構與擴增實境、車用透明顯示等應用；不含折射率調制或配方數據。","scopeEn":"Describes the Bayfol HX self-developing holographic photopolymer, its recording-wavelength range (440–680 nm class), three-layer structure and applications in augmented reality and automotive transparent displays; no index-modulation or formulation data."},{"title":"Wasatch Photonics：體相位全像光柵技術說明","titleEn":"Wasatch Photonics: Volume phase holographic grating technology","publisher":"Wasatch Photonics","url":"https://wasatchphotonics.com/technologies/volume-phase-holographic-gratings/","scope":"說明 VPH 光柵以折射率調制而非表面刻槽工作、以厚度與調制幅度設計工作波長，以及相對表面浮雕光柵的偏振相依性與入射角調諧行為；為公開技術頁。","scopeEn":"Explains that VPH gratings work by index modulation rather than grooves, that working wavelength is set by thickness and modulation amplitude, and compares polarization dependence and angle tuning with surface-relief gratings; a public technology page."},{"title":"ESO：MUSE 儀器描述（體相位全像光柵光譜儀）","titleEn":"ESO: MUSE instrument description (VPH grating spectrographs)","publisher":"European Southern Observatory","url":"https://www.eso.org/sci/facilities/paranal/instruments/muse/inst.html","scope":"公開列出 MUSE 每個光譜儀由準直鏡、體相位全像光柵與相機組成，波段 480–930 nm、解析力約 1770 至 3590；作為體全像光柵在天文儀器中的實際應用參照。","scopeEn":"Publicly lists each MUSE spectrograph as collimator, volume phase holographic grating and camera, covering 480–930 nm with resolving power about 1770 to 3590; a reference for volume gratings in a real astronomical instrument."},{"title":"HORIBA：刻劃式與全像式繞射光柵技術頁","titleEn":"HORIBA: Ruled and holographic diffraction gratings","publisher":"HORIBA","url":"https://www.horiba.com/int/scientific/technologies/diffraction-gratings/diffraction-gratings-ruled-and-holographic/","scope":"說明全像光柵以兩束雷射干涉條紋曝光製作、無週期刻劃誤差故無鬼線、雜散光較低、可達 6000 線/mm 與離子蝕刻層狀槽形；不含製程參數。","scopeEn":"Explains that holographic gratings are exposed with two-beam laser interference fringes, have no ghosts because there are no periodic ruling errors, show lower stray light, reach 6000 lines/mm and can be ion-etched to laminar profiles; no process parameters."}]},{"courseId":"a417","overview":"以可遷移的原理、量測與驗證比較相近儀器；關聯不表示同一廠商、世代或驗收規格。","overviewEn":"Compare neighbouring instruments through transferable principles, measurements and validation; a link does not imply the same vendor, generation or acceptance requirements.","related":[{"id":"a416","title":"繞射光學元件製作","titleEn":"Diffractive optical-element fabrication","transfer":"可遷移「廣義 Snell 定律與相位取樣」與「聚焦效率、PSF 與 Strehl 量測」的建模、量測與誤差預算方法；繞射光學元件製作的元件、尺度與允收條件需重新設定。","transferEn":"The modelling, measurement and error-budget methods of \"Generalized Snell law and phase sampling\" and \"Focusing efficiency, PSF and Strehl measurement\" transfer, while components, scales and acceptance conditions of Diffractive optical-element fabrication must be respecified.","difference":"本課聚焦從超穎原子相位庫到 EBL／DUV 曝光、高深寬比蝕刻與聚焦效率驗收的平面透鏡製程工程；繞射光學元件製作則以以純量繞射效率、相位階數與蝕刻深度控制，把微影製作的繞射元件做到可驗收的效率與零級洩漏為重點，不能直接沿用參數或允收值。","differenceEn":"This course focuses on from meta-atom phase libraries to EBL/DUV exposure, high-aspect-ratio etching and focusing-efficiency acceptance of flat lenses; Diffractive optical-element fabrication centres on bringing lithographically made diffractive elements to acceptable efficiency and zero-order leakage through scalar efficiency, phase-level count and etch-depth control, so parameters and acceptance values do not transfer unchanged.","practice":["比較系統邊界：列出「雙曲相位剖面與取樣格點」與「2π 相位摺疊與 M 階階梯」的輸入、輸出與主要干擾。","把本課算例的一個假設移到繞射光學元件製作，標出可沿用的方程與必須重設的參數。","以「效率預算：量化、深度、套準與散射」為例，設計一項能區分兩種系統的驗證量測，並註明不確定度。"],"practiceEn":["Compare system boundaries: list the inputs, outputs and main disturbances of “Hyperbolic phase profile and sampling lattice” and “2π phase wrapping and the M-level staircase”.","Move one assumption of this course's worked example to Diffractive optical-element fabrication, separating reusable equations from parameters that must be respecified.","Using \"Efficiency budget: quantisation, depth, overlay and scatter\", design a verification measurement that distinguishes the two systems and state its uncertainty."],"referenceUrls":["https://apps.dtic.mil/sti/pdfs/ADA213404.pdf","https://www.holoor.co.il/capabilities","https://www.jenoptik.com/products/optical-systems/optical-precision-components/diffractive-optical-elements-doe-microoptics"],"place":{"name":"麻省理工學院林肯實驗室二元光學參照點","nameEn":"MIT Lincoln Laboratory binary-optics reference","city":"麻省理工學院林肯實驗室二元光學參照點","cityEn":"MIT Lincoln Laboratory binary-optics reference","countr